<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b66ff">
<meta name="description" content="UnoVelho Matematixa — UNO com matemática, personagens e multiplayer.">
<title>Uno dos Idosos</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css?v=20260815-opt8">
</head>
<body>

<main id="platformScreen" class="screen platform-screen">
  <section class="platform-card glass">
    <div class="platform-logo"><span>U</span><div>UNO VELHO<small>MATEMATIXA</small></div></div>
    <div class="platform-kicker">ANTES DE ENTRAR NA MESA</div>
    <h1>Escolha sua plataforma</h1>
    <p>O jogo se adapta ao modo escolhido. No celular, a partida usa a tela deitada para ficar igual a uma mesa de cartas.</p>
    <div class="platform-options">
      <button id="btnPlatformMobile" class="platform-option mobile" type="button"><span class="platform-icon">📱</span><b>CELULAR</b><small>Tela deitada • toque • interface compacta</small></button>
      <button id="btnPlatformComputer" class="platform-option computer" type="button"><span class="platform-icon">🖥️</span><b>COMPUTADOR</b><small>Mouse • teclado • tela ampla</small></button>
    </div>
    <small class="platform-note">Você poderá trocar essa opção em Configurações.</small>
  </section>
</main>

<div id="orientationGuard" class="orientation-guard hidden"><div class="rotate-phone">↻</div><h2>Vire o celular</h2><p>A partida foi feita para jogar deitado, como uma mesa de cartas.</p></div>

<div id="bootScreen" class="boot-screen hidden"><div class="loader-logo">UNO<span>VELHO</span></div><div class="loader-ring"></div><p>Carregando a dimensão Matematixa...</p></div>

<main id="authScreen" class="screen auth-screen">
  <div class="floating-cards" aria-hidden="true"><span class="float-card f1">7</span><span class="float-card f2">+2</span><span class="float-card f3">🌈</span><span class="float-card f4">3</span><span class="float-card f5">🔄</span><span class="float-card f6">9</span><span class="float-card f7">+4</span><span class="float-card f8">5</span></div>
  <section class="auth-shell glass">
    <div class="auth-brand"><div class="logo-mark">U</div><div><div class="brand-title">UNO VELHO</div><div class="brand-sub">MATEMATIXA</div></div></div>
    <div class="auth-copy"><span class="pill">🧠 CARTAS + MATEMÁTICA</span><h1>Entre na mesa.</h1><p>Jogue sozinho, desafie jogadores e construa seu personagem.</p></div>
    <div class="auth-tabs"><button class="auth-tab active" data-auth="login">ENTRAR</button><button class="auth-tab" data-auth="register">CRIAR CONTA</button></div>
    <div class="auth-grid">
      <form id="formLogin" class="auth-form glass-inner">
        <div class="form-kicker">🔐 ACESSO SEGURO</div><h2>Entrar no jogo</h2>
        <label>Usuário<input name="username" autocomplete="username" maxlength="24" required placeholder="Seu usuário"></label>
        <label>Senha<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required placeholder="Sua senha"></label>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-wide" type="submit">ENTRAR NA CONTA</button><div id="loginMessage" class="form-message"></div>
      </form>
      <form id="formRegister" class="auth-form glass-inner hidden">
        <div class="form-kicker">✨ NOVO JOGADOR</div><h2>Criar conta</h2>
        <label>Usuário<input name="regUsername" maxlength="24" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_]{3,24}" required placeholder="3 a 24 caracteres"></label>
        <label>Senha<input name="regPassword" type="password" minlength="6" maxlength="100" required placeholder="Mínimo de 6 caracteres"></label>
        <button class="btn btn-cyan btn-wide" type="submit">CRIAR CONTA E JOGAR</button><div id="registerMessage" class="form-message"></div>
      </form>
    </div>
        <div class="auth-foot">🔒 Login seguro • PostgreSQL • Socket.IO</div>
  </section>
</main>

<main id="appScreen" class="screen app-screen hidden">
<header class="topbar glass">
  <button id="brandHome" class="brand-button" type="button"><span class="mini-logo">U</span><span><b>UNO VELHO</b><small>MATEMATIXA</small></span></button>
  <div class="top-actions"><div class="currency">🪙 <b id="coinValueTop">0</b></div><div class="level-chip"><span>NÍVEL</span><b id="levelValueTop">1</b></div><button id="btnOpenProfile" class="avatar-mini" type="button">🙂</button><button id="btnOpenSettings" class="icon-btn" type="button">⚙️</button></div>
</header>

<section id="lobbyView" class="view lobby-v2">
  <div class="menu-bg-scene" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="bg-glow glow-a"></div><div class="bg-glow glow-b"></div>
    <div class="bg-card bg-card-a">7</div><div class="bg-card bg-card-b">+2</div><div class="bg-card bg-card-c">↻</div>
    <div class="chase-track">
      <div class="chase-dust dust-a"></div><div class="chase-dust dust-b"></div><div class="chase-dust dust-c"></div>
      <div class="chase-old"><span class="old-cane">╱</span><span class="old-body">👴</span></div>
      <div class="chase-mom"><span class="mom-body">👩</span><span class="slipper">🩴</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <header class="menu-top-v2">
    <div class="player-card-v2 glass">
      <button id="btnOpenProfileMenu" class="menu-avatar-button" type="button"><span>🙂</span></button>
      <div class="player-card-info"><b id="heroName">Jogador</b><span>NÍVEL <strong id="levelValue">1</strong></span><div class="xp-line"><span id="xpBar"></span></div><small><span id="xpValue">0</span> XP</small></div>
    </div>
    <div class="brand-3d-v2"><div class="uno-3d">UNO</div><div class="velho-3d">DO VELHO</div><span>MATEMATIXA</span></div>
    <div class="economy-v2"><div>🪙 <b id="coinValue">0</b></div><button id="btnBattlePass" class="pass-big-btn" type="button">🎟️ PASSE DE NÍVEL <small>1 → 100</small></button></div>
  </header>

  <div class="menu-main-v2">
    <section class="menu-character-column">
      <div class="character-platform-v2">
        <div id="heroCharacter" class="character-stage menu-character"></div>
        <div class="platform-ring"></div>
      </div>
      <button id="btnCustomize" class="edit-skin-v2" type="button"><span>✏️</span><b>EDITAR SKIN</b></button>
      <button id="btnInventory" class="character-small-action" type="button">🎒 INVENTÁRIO</button>
    </section>

    <section class="main-buttons-v2">
      <button id="btnPlay" class="big-menu-btn green" type="button"><span class="btn-icon">🃏</span><span><b>JOGAR</b><small>ENTRAR EM UMA PARTIDA</small></span><i>›</i></button>
      <button id="btnCreateRoomLobby" class="big-menu-btn blue" type="button"><span class="btn-icon">👥</span><span><b>CRIAR PARTIDA</b><small>CHAME SEUS AMIGOS</small></span><i>›</i></button>
      <button id="btnMapsPreview" class="big-menu-btn gold" type="button"><span class="btn-icon">🗺️</span><span><b>ESCOLHER MAPA</b><small>BAR • NAVIO • CASA • TAVERNA</small></span><i>›</i></button>
      <button id="btnShop" class="big-menu-btn purple" type="button"><span class="btn-icon">🛒</span><span><b>LOJA</b><small>SKINS • ROUPAS • ACESSÓRIOS</small></span><i>›</i></button>
    </section>

    <aside class="right-rail-v2">
      <button id="btnCEO" class="rail-btn ceo-rail" type="button" style="display:none"><span>👑</span><b>PAINEL CEO</b></button><button id="btnOpenSettingsRail" class="rail-btn" type="button"><span>⚙️</span><b>CONFIGURAÇÕES</b></button>
      <button id="btnRankSmall" class="rail-btn" type="button"><span>🏆</span><b>RANK MUNDIAL</b></button>
      <button id="btnGlobalChat" class="rail-btn chat-rail" type="button"><span>💬</span><b>CHAT GLOBAL</b></button>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <button id="btnGlobalChatOpen" class="global-chat-v2 glass global-chat-button" type="button"><span class="global-dot">🌎</span><span><b>CHAT GLOBAL</b><small id="globalChatPreview">Sem novas mensagens</small></span><i>💬</i></button>
  <div class="menu-status-v2"><span>🟢 SERVIDORES ONLINE</span><span>•</span><span>🎮 JOGADORES CONECTADOS</span></div><button id="btnCEOFloat" class="ceo-floating glass" type="button" hidden>👑 PAINEL CEO</button>
</section>

<section id="playView" class="view hidden modes-view">
  <div class="subnav"><button class="back-btn" data-back="lobby" type="button">← Voltar</button><div><h2>JOGAR UNO</h2><small class="subnav-subtitle">Escolha como quer jogar o UNO Velho Matematixa.</small></div></div>
  <div class="mode-hub-actions uno-only-play">
    <button id="btnSolo" class="mode-hub-btn solo" type="button"><span>🤖</span><b>SOLO</b><small>Jogue contra o bot</small></button>
    <button id="btnOnline" class="mode-hub-btn online" type="button"><span>🌎</span><b>ONLINE</b><small>Crie ou entre em uma sala</small></button>
  </div>
  <div class="mode-showcase compact uno-only-showcase">
    <article class="game-mode-card mode-uno"><div class="mode-art">🃏</div><div><span class="mode-pill live">UNO</span><h3>UNO VELHO MATEMATIXA</h3><p>Cartas, bot pensando, mapas, chat e UNOOO!</p></div></article>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="onlineModeView" class="view hidden">
  <div class="subnav"><button class="back-btn" data-back="play" type="button">← Voltar</button><div><h2>UNO ONLINE</h2><small class="subnav-subtitle">Salas exclusivas de UNO Velho Matematixa.</small></div></div>
  <div class="online-mode-grid uno-only-grid">
    <button class="online-mode-card mode-uno" data-online-mode="uno" type="button"><span>🃏</span><b>UNO</b><small>Cartas + UNO!!!</small><em>SALAS</em></button>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="soloView" class="view hidden">
  <div class="subnav"><button class="back-btn" data-back="play" type="button">← Voltar</button><h2>JOGAR UNO SOLO</h2></div>
  <div class="solo-mode-grid uno-only-grid">
    <button class="solo-mode-card mode-uno" data-solo-mode="uno" type="button"><span>🃏</span><b>UNO</b><small>Contra bot</small></button>
  </div>
  <div class="solo-difficulty-row"><b>Dificuldade:</b><button class="difficulty" data-difficulty="easy" type="button">🟢 Fácil</button><button class="difficulty" data-difficulty="medium" type="button">🟡 Médio</button><button class="difficulty" data-difficulty="hard" type="button">🔴 Difícil</button></div>
</section>
<section id="roomsView" class="view hidden"><div class="subnav"><button class="back-btn" data-back="onlineModeView" type="button">← Modos</button><div><h2 id="roomsHeading">SALAS DE UNO</h2><small id="roomsModeSubtitle" class="subnav-subtitle">Escolha uma sala para entrar.</small></div><div class="subnav-actions"><button id="btnRefreshRooms" class="btn btn-secondary" type="button">↻ Atualizar</button><button id="btnCreateRoom" class="btn btn-primary" type="button">＋ CRIAR SALA</button></div></div><div id="roomsList" class="rooms-list"></div></section>
<section id="roomView" class="view hidden"><div class="subnav"><button id="btnLeaveRoom" class="back-btn" type="button">← Sair da sala</button><h2 id="roomTitle">SALA</h2><span id="roomCodeBadge" class="code-badge">MATX-0000</span></div><div class="room-layout"><div class="room-main glass"><div class="room-options-bar"><span id="roomOptionsText">Sala</span><button id="btnStartRoom" class="btn btn-primary" type="button">▶ COMEÇAR</button></div><div id="roomPlayers" class="room-players"></div><div id="roomMapBanner" class="room-map-banner"></div></div><aside class="chat-panel glass"><div class="chat-head"><b>💬 CHAT</b><span>ONLINE</span></div><div id="roomChatMessages" class="chat-messages"></div><form id="roomChatForm" class="chat-form"><input id="roomChatInput" maxlength="500" placeholder="Digite uma mensagem..."><button type="submit">➤</button></form></aside></div></section>

<section id="gameView" class="view hidden game-view">
  <div id="globalPauseBanner" class="pause-banner hidden"></div>
  <div class="game-stage-3d first-person-stage">
    <aside id="gameGlobalChat" class="game-chat-left chat-panel glass hidden">
      <div class="chat-head"><b>🌎 CHAT GLOBAL</b><button id="btnCloseGlobalChat" type="button">×</button></div>
      <div id="gameChatTyping" class="game-chat-typing hidden"></div>
      <div id="gameChatMessages" class="chat-messages"></div>
      <form id="gameChatForm" class="chat-form"><input id="gameChatInput" maxlength="500" placeholder="Mensagem global..."><button type="submit">➤</button></form>
    </aside>
    <button id="btnGameGlobalChat" class="game-global-chat-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Abrir chat global">💬</button>

    <div id="arenaShell" class="arena-shell arena-3d first-person-arena" data-map-theme="saloon">
      <header class="arena-top">
        <div class="game-stat"><span>PARTIDA</span><b id="roundText">1 / 1</b></div>
        <div id="turnStatus" class="turn-badge">SUA VEZ!</div>
        <div class="arena-tools"><button id="btnSound" class="icon-btn" type="button">🔊</button><button id="btnBackGame" class="icon-btn" type="button">✕</button></div>
      </header>

      <div id="mapScene" class="saloon-map map-saloon first-person-map">
        <div class="map-ceiling-lights"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
        <div id="mapDecor" class="map-decor" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="far-wall"><span class="map-sign">UNO DO VELHO</span></div>
        <div class="table-shadow"></div>
        <div class="wood-table first-person-table">
          <div class="table-rim"></div>
          <div class="table-felt"></div>
          <div class="table-grain"></div>
          <div class="table-cup cup-left">🍺</div><div class="table-cup cup-right">🍺</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="opponents" class="opponents table-players first-person-opponents"></div>

      <div class="table-center-3d first-person-center">
        <div class="deck-area"><button id="drawStack" class="draw-stack" type="button" aria-label="Comprar carta"><span class="uno-card back-card">UNO</span><b id="deckCount">0</b></button><small>COMPRAR</small></div>
        <div class="discard-area main-discard"><div class="center-card-shadow"></div><div id="discardPile" class="uno-card card-red big-card center-card">7</div><div id="colorIndicator" class="color-indicator">VERMELHO</div></div>
        <div id="playedCards" class="played-cards"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="table-status"><span id="gameTableMessage">Clique em uma carta para jogar.</span></div>
      <div id="gameActionLayer" class="game-action-layer"></div>

      <div class="first-person-hands" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="fp-arm fp-arm-left"></div><div class="fp-arm fp-arm-right"></div>
        <div class="fp-hand fp-hand-left">✋</div><div class="fp-hand fp-hand-right">🤚</div>
      </div>

      <div class="player-zone first-person-player-zone">
        <div class="player-self"><div class="self-emote player-emote" data-emote-for="self"></div><div class="self-profile"><div id="gameAvatar" class="avatar-game"></div><div><b id="gamePlayerName">Jogador</b><small id="gamePlayerTitle">INICIANTE</small></div></div><button id="btnUno" class="uno-call" type="button">UNO!</button></div>
        <div id="playerHand" class="hand-cards hand-fan-3d"></div>
        <div class="game-emotes" id="emoteTray"><button data-emote="😀" type="button">😀</button><button data-emote="😂" type="button">😂</button><button data-emote="😡" type="button">😡</button><button data-emote="🔥" type="button">🔥</button><button data-emote="👏" type="button">👏</button><button data-emote="🎉" type="button">🎉</button></div>
        <div id="gameToast" class="game-toast"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>





<section id="customizeView" class="view hidden customize-page">
  <div class="subnav"><button class="back-btn" data-back="lobby" type="button">← Voltar</button><div><h2>EDITAR PERSONAGEM</h2><small class="subnav-subtitle">Escolha roupas, cabelo e acessórios com prévias visuais.</small></div><button id="btnSaveCharacterTop" class="btn btn-primary" type="button">💾 SALVAR</button></div>
  <div class="custom-page-layout">
    <aside class="custom-showcase glass">
      <div class="showcase-badge">✨ SEU PERSONAGEM</div>
      <div id="customCharacterPage" class="character-stage custom-page-character"></div>
      <b id="customNamePage">Jogador</b><span id="customTitlePage" class="title-badge">INICIANTE</span>
      <div class="equipped-list" id="equippedList"></div>
      <button id="btnSaveCharacter" class="btn btn-primary btn-wide" type="button">SALVAR PERSONAGEM</button>
    </aside>
    <section class="custom-picker glass">
      <div class="custom-picker-head"><div><span class="pill">🧥 GUARDA-ROUPA</span><h3>Escolha seu estilo</h3></div><span id="customOwnedCount" class="owned-counter">0 itens</span></div>
      <div class="custom-category-tabs" id="customCategoryTabs">
        <button class="custom-cat active" data-custom-cat="top" type="button">👕 Roupas</button><button class="custom-cat" data-custom-cat="hair" type="button">💇 Cabelo</button><button class="custom-cat" data-custom-cat="bottom" type="button">👖 Calças</button><button class="custom-cat" data-custom-cat="shoes" type="button">👟 Tênis</button><button class="custom-cat" data-custom-cat="accessory" type="button">🕶️ Acessórios</button><button class="custom-cat" data-custom-cat="effect" type="button">✨ Efeitos</button>
      </div>
      <div id="customSkinStrip" class="skin-strip"><b>🎨 Pele</b><button class="swatch" data-skin="#f1c7a7" style="background:#f1c7a7" type="button" aria-label="Pele clara"></button><button class="swatch" data-skin="#d59b76" style="background:#d59b76" type="button" aria-label="Pele média"></button><button class="swatch" data-skin="#9b684a" style="background:#9b684a" type="button" aria-label="Pele morena"></button><button class="swatch" data-skin="#6b422e" style="background:#6b422e" type="button" aria-label="Pele escura"></button></div>
      <div id="customCatalog" class="custom-catalog"></div>
      <div class="custom-note">🔒 Itens bloqueados podem ser comprados na loja. Itens já adquiridos podem ser equipados com um toque.</div>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="battlePassView" class="view hidden">
  <div class="subnav"><button class="back-btn" data-back="lobby" type="button">← Voltar</button><div><h2>🎟️ PASSE DE NÍVEL</h2><small class="subnav-subtitle">Chegue ao nível 100. Quanto mais alto, mais difícil.</small></div><button id="btnClaimAllPass" class="btn btn-primary" type="button">🎁 COLETAR TUDO</button></div>
  <div class="pass-hero glass"><div><span class="pill">UNO VELHO MATEMATIXA</span><h3>O caminho até o 100</h3><p>Começa fácil. Depois o XP sobe de verdade. Só os teimosos chegam ao 100.</p></div><div class="pass-level-big"><small>NÍVEL</small><b id="passCurrentLevel">1</b><span>/100</span></div></div>
  <div class="pass-progress glass"><div class="pass-progress-head"><b id="passXpText">0 XP</b><span id="passNextText">Próximo nível</span></div><div class="pass-progress-track"><i id="passXpBar"></i></div></div>
  <div id="passGrid" class="pass-grid"></div>
</section>
<section id="shopView" class="view hidden"><div class="subnav"><button class="back-btn" data-back="lobby" type="button">← Voltar</button><h2>LOJA</h2><div class="shop-tabs"><button class="shop-tab active" data-shop="official" type="button">🏪 CATÁLOGO</button></div></div><div id="shopGrid" class="item-grid"></div></section>
<section id="inventoryView" class="view hidden"><div class="subnav"><button class="back-btn" data-back="lobby" type="button">← Voltar</button><h2>INVENTÁRIO</h2></div><div class="profile-layout"><div class="profile-card glass"><div id="profileCharacterLarge" class="character-stage large"></div><h3 id="profileName">Jogador</h3><span id="profileTitle" class="title-badge">INICIANTE</span><div class="profile-stats"><div><b id="profileLevel">1</b><small>Nível</small></div><div><b id="profileWins">0</b><small>Vitórias</small></div><div><b id="profileGames">0</b><small>Partidas</small></div></div></div><div class="inventory-panel glass"><div class="inventory-tabs"><button class="inventory-tab active" data-inv="items" type="button">🎒 Itens</button><button class="inventory-tab" data-inv="achievements" type="button">🏆 Conquistas</button></div><div id="inventoryContent"></div></div></div></section>
<section id="rankView" class="view hidden"><div class="subnav"><button class="back-btn" data-back="play" type="button">← Voltar</button><h2>RANK MUNDIAL</h2></div><div class="rank-table glass"><div class="rank-head"><span>#</span><span>Jogador</span><span>Nível</span><span>XP</span><span>Vitórias</span></div><div id="rankRows"></div></div></section>
<section id="settingsView" class="view hidden"><div class="subnav"><button class="back-btn" data-back="lobby" type="button">← Voltar</button><h2>CONFIGURAÇÕES</h2></div><div class="settings-grid"><div class="panel glass"><h3>🔊 Áudio</h3><label class="toggle-row"><span>Música</span><input id="setMusic" type="checkbox"></label><label>Volume da música<input id="setMusicVol" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05"></label><label class="toggle-row"><span>Efeitos</span><input id="setSfx" type="checkbox"></label><label>Volume dos efeitos<input id="setSfxVol" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.05"></label></div><div class="panel glass"><h3>✨ Interface</h3><label class="toggle-row"><span>Animações</span><input id="setAnimations" type="checkbox"></label><label class="toggle-row"><span>Movimento reduzido</span><input id="setReducedMotion" type="checkbox"></label><h3>💬 Chat</h3><label class="toggle-row"><span>Chat mundial</span><input id="setWorldChat" type="checkbox"></label><label class="toggle-row"><span>Chat da sala</span><input id="setRoomChat" type="checkbox"></label><label class="toggle-row"><span>Chat privado</span><input id="setPrivateChat" type="checkbox"></label></div><div class="panel glass"><h3>👤 Conta</h3><p id="accountInfo"></p><button id="btnLogout" class="btn btn-danger btn-wide" type="button">SAIR DA CONTA</button></div></div></section>
</main>

<div id="customizeModal" class="modal-overlay hidden"><div class="modal custom-modal"><div class="modal-head"><div><span class="pill">✨ CRIADOR</span><h2>Personalizar personagem</h2></div><button class="close-modal" data-close="customizeModal" type="button">×</button></div><div class="custom-layout"><div class="custom-preview"><div id="customCharacter" class="character-stage huge"></div><b id="customNamePreview">Jogador</b><span id="customTitlePreview" class="title-badge">INICIANTE</span></div><div class="custom-controls"><div class="control-section"><b>🎨 Aparência</b><div class="option-row"><button class="swatch" data-skin="#f1c7a7" style="background:#f1c7a7" type="button"></button><button class="swatch" data-skin="#d59b76" style="background:#d59b76" type="button"></button><button class="swatch" data-skin="#9b684a" style="background:#9b684a" type="button"></button><button class="swatch" data-skin="#6b422e" style="background:#6b422e" type="button"></button></div><label>Olhos<select id="customEyes"><option value="#1d2433">Azul escuro</option><option value="#2d6b3f">Verde</option><option value="#4d2b1d">Castanho</option><option value="#6e4bbd">Roxo</option></select></label><label>Cabelo<select id="customHair"></select></label><label>Cor do cabelo<select id="customHairColor"><option value="#171717">Preto</option><option value="#5a301c">Castanho</option><option value="#e2c044">Dourado</option><option value="#23d9ff">Neon</option><option value="#eaf7ff">Gelo</option></select></label></div><div class="control-section"><b>👕 Roupas</b><label>Parte de cima<select id="customTop"></select></label><label>Parte de baixo<select id="customBottom"></select></label><label>Calçado<select id="customShoes"></select></label></div><div class="control-section"><b>✨ Extras</b><label>Acessório<select id="customAccessory"></select></label><label>Aura<select id="customEffect"></select></label><label>Emote<select id="customEmote"></select></label><label>Título<select id="customTitle"></select></label></div><button id="btnSaveCharacterModal" class="btn btn-primary btn-wide" type="button">SALVAR PERSONAGEM</button></div></div></div></div>

<div id="createRoomModal" class="modal-overlay hidden"><div class="modal modal-wide"><div class="modal-head"><div><span class="pill">🌎 MULTIPLAYER</span><h2>Criar sala</h2></div><button class="close-modal" data-close="createRoomModal" type="button">×</button></div><div class="form-grid"><input type="hidden" id="roomGameMode" value="uno"><div class="full uno-room-mode"><span class="pill">🃏 MODO FIXO</span><b>UNO VELHO MATEMATIXA</b><small>Esta versão é exclusiva para UNO.</small></div><label>Nome<input id="roomName" maxlength="40" placeholder="Mesa da galera"></label><label>Senha opcional<input id="roomPassword" maxlength="40" type="password"></label><label>Jogadores<select id="roomMax"><option>2</option><option>3</option><option selected>4</option><option>5</option><option>6</option><option>7</option><option>8</option></select></label><label>Tempo<select id="roomTime"><option value="20">20s</option><option value="30">30s</option><option selected value="45">45s</option><option value="60">60s</option><option value="90">90s</option></select></label><label>Dificuldade<select id="roomDifficulty"><option value="easy">Fácil</option><option value="medium" selected>Médio</option><option value="hard">Difícil</option></select></label><label>Bots<select id="roomBots"><option value="2">2</option><option value="4" selected>4</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="8">8</option></select></label><label class="full">Mapa<select id="roomMap"></select></label><label>Cartas iniciais<select id="roomCards"><option>5</option><option>6</option><option selected>7</option><option>8</option><option>10</option></select></label><label class="toggle-row"><span>Permitir bots</span><input id="roomAllowBots" type="checkbox" checked></label><label class="toggle-row"><span>Cartas especiais</span><input id="roomSpecials" type="checkbox" checked></label><label class="toggle-row"><span>Empilhar +2/+4</span><input id="roomStack" type="checkbox"></label><label class="toggle-row"><span>Chat</span><input id="roomChat" type="checkbox" checked></label></div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn btn-secondary close-modal" data-close="createRoomModal" type="button">CANCELAR</button><button id="btnConfirmCreateRoom" class="btn btn-primary" type="button">CRIAR SALA</button></div></div></div>
<div id="joinRoomModal" class="modal-overlay hidden"><div class="modal modal-narrow"><div class="modal-head"><h2>Entrar na sala</h2><button class="close-modal" data-close="joinRoomModal" type="button">×</button></div><p id="joinRoomInfo"></p><label>Senha<input id="joinRoomPassword" type="password"></label><button id="btnConfirmJoinRoom" class="btn btn-primary btn-wide" type="button">ENTRAR</button></div></div>
<div id="colorModal" class="modal-overlay hidden"><div class="modal modal-narrow"><div class="math-icon">🌈</div><h2>Escolha a cor</h2><div class="color-picker"><button data-color="red" type="button">VERMELHO</button><button data-color="yellow" type="button">AMARELO</button><button data-color="green" type="button">VERDE</button><button data-color="blue" type="button">AZUL</button></div></div></div>

<div id="globalChatPanel" class="global-chat-panel glass hidden">
  <div class="chat-head"><b>🌎 CHAT GLOBAL</b><button id="btnCloseGlobalChatLobby" type="button">×</button></div>
  <div id="globalChatMessagesLobby" class="chat-messages"></div>
  <form id="globalChatFormLobby" class="chat-form"><input id="globalChatInputLobby" maxlength="500" placeholder="Mensagem global..."><button type="submit">➤</button></form>
</div>
<div id="ceoPanel" class="modal-overlay hidden"><div class="modal modal-wide ceo-modal"><div class="modal-head"><div><span class="pill">👑 CEO</span><h2>Painel de Controle</h2><small>Conta autorizada: <b>CeoVelho</b></small></div><button class="close-modal" id="btnCloseCEO" type="button">×</button></div><div class="ceo-grid"><div class="panel"><h3>⚡ Controle global</h3><div class="ceo-actions"><button id="ceoFreeze" class="btn btn-danger">⏸ PARALISAR JOGO</button><button id="ceoUnfreeze" class="btn btn-primary">▶ DESCONGELAR</button><button id="ceoResetPodium" class="btn btn-secondary">🏆 RESETAR PÓDIO</button><button id="ceoClearLogins" class="btn btn-secondary">🧹 LIMPAR LOGINS</button></div><label>Mensagem global<input id="ceoMessage" maxlength="300" placeholder="Mensagem para todos"></label><button id="ceoSendMessage" class="btn btn-primary btn-wide">📢 ENVIAR</button></div><div class="panel"><h3>👥 Jogadores</h3><div id="ceoUsers" class="ceo-users"></div></div></div></div></div><div id="toastContainer" class="toast-container" aria-live="polite"></div>
<script>
(function(){
  // Segurança contra versões antigas do PWA: nunca bloqueia o carregamento.
  try {
    if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) {
      navigator.serviceWorker.getRegistrations().then(function(rs){
        rs.forEach(function(r){ r.unregister().catch(function(){}); });
      }).catch(function(){});
    }
    if ('caches' in window) {
      caches.keys().then(function(keys){
        keys.forEach(function(k){
          if (/unovelho|uno/i.test(k)) caches.delete(k).catch(function(){});
        });
      }).catch(function(){});
    }
  } catch(e) {}
})();
</script>
<script src="app.js?v=20260816-4" defer></script>

</body>
</html>
